kernel.decl @qwen38_residual_add_f32_prefill(%tokens: index) launch(%tokens: index, %lhs: buffer, %rhs: buffer, %output: buffer)

// The global-decoding schedule independently acquires Q6 codes and scales.
// Finite channel-varying weights and binary-exact iota activations exercise
// pipelined metadata consumption, F32/F16 input storage, and fused residuals.
// Every inactive output retains its original contents.

